  // The result phase, the third of the rebuilt phases: what a finished session says about itself. The headline is the verdict word when there is one - these three stand in for the outcomes that never produced a verdict. Under it the facts the summary carries, then the way on.
  "result.headline_did_not_take_effect": "Did not take effect",
