  "calc.err.step_unsupported": "One of the steps is not built in this version yet, so there is no result to show.",
  "calc.err.degenerate_calendar": "The chosen calendar marks (almost) every day as a day off, so a business-day step has nowhere to land - check its weekend and holidays.",
